{
  "about": "The one spelling of a recorded decision instant (ess-history/2 `decision_time`): an RFC 3339 instant in UTC with `Z`, seconds 00-59, and a fraction of one to nine digits only when it is not zero, with no trailing zero. Rust (`DecisionInstant::parse`), Go (`ParseDecisionInstant`) and TypeScript (`parseDecisionInstant`) admit exactly `valid` and refuse every `invalid`.",
